  "definition": "Alternate Frequency for Repeat Standard Public Notice for CWS",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-01-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; amd by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
